abstract: >-
  A classical machine learning system for plant disease classification
  from leaf images using hand-crafted features (color, texture, shape)
  and fertilizer recommendation using soil/climate data. Supports
  SVM, KNN, Logistic Regression, and Random Forest with Stratified
  K-Fold Cross Validation. Built as a college mini project.
